{
 "chapter": "primitives",
 "speak": "a taxonomy that opens what it cannot hold: the trace, the endlessness of pi. on one side ignorance, on the other melancholia — underfitting, overfitting. queer melancholia: not an endless mutation, entropy forbids it; a drift, an edge drift. this is the endless museum.",
